+        "the degree-2 graph connected and 3-regular, while Sections 8 and 9 give "
+        "meet-in-the-middle cost O(2^(e/2)) for a planted non-backtracking walk "
+        "of degree 2^e; shipping uses e=42 over p=2^61-1, and the measured "
