The final local evidence is complete. The oracle service remains unavailable on the bare, structural-hint, and placebo runs; all twelve script-owned calls were recorded as errors and none were counted as attempts or failures. I’m documenting that limitation prominently—local gates pass, but the required model-hardness verdict is not established.
